<title>FRANCE: JUPPE SAYS RENAULT METHOD NOT RIGHT.</title>
<headline>JUPPE SAYS RENAULT METHOD NOT RIGHT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Prime Minister Alain Juppe believes the method used by Renault &quot;was not the right one&quot;, government spokesman Alain Lamassoure said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
